    {"fact": "内容eCPM=总收入÷（总分润PV/1000），其中分润PV是有效阅读超过5秒的PV；eCPM受内容主题与广告召回匹配、内容价值、作者成长和生态调节等因素影响。", "course_evidence_ids": ["BAIJIA-C00083", "BAIJIA-C00084", "BAIJIA-C00151", "BAIJIA-C00152", "BAIJIA-C00154-R002", "BAIJIA-C00154-R003", "BAIJIA-C00154-R004", "BAIJIA-C00154-R005", "BAIJIA-C00154-R006"], "confidence": "high"},
    {"fact": "60天招募3500人；拉新促活支出43.56万元、基础分润支出156万元、总支出199.56万元；第4周留存81.29%，最后一周留存45.31%。", "course_evidence_ids": ["BAIJIA-C00184", "BAIJIA-C00185", "BAIJIA-C00186", "BAIJIA-C00187", "BAIJIA-C00188", "BAIJIA-C00189", "BAIJIA-C00190"], "confidence": "high"}
